WEBVTT

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.820
This sucks! This is the worst day ever!

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:13.110
If you've got time to bitch, 
you could be running faster!

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.830
What good is running even gonna do?!

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.990
If we keep running 'til we're out of 
this forest, we can contact the guild!

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:21.500
Again!

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.040
What good would that even do?!

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.180
That thing...

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:26.830
That thing...

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.540
It'll wipe out more than just the town.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.500
It'll destroy the entire kingdom!

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:10.980
The Magical Revolution

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:10.980
The Magical Revolution

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:10.980
of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:27.050
I was out for a while...

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:29.910
Sorry about that. 
Thanks for lending me your lap.

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:34.380
Not at all. I'm just glad 
I could be somewhat useful.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.260
Princess.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.440
You mustn't doze off outside like this.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.850
You caught me, huh?

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:52.050
Euphie's lap was just so comfy to sleep on.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:56.820
Honestly, Princess, you so readily leave 
yourself vulnerable to the person you like.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.150
Just like a dog—

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.230
I mean...

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:03.210
Ilia, were you about to say 
something super disrespectful?

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:05.160
Most certainly not.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:10.280
I merely thought that even a stray dog would 
devote more attention to personal grooming.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.400
D-Disrespect! Disrespect! No tact at all!

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:20.060
Incidentally, your odor was so foul that 
a stray dog would whimper and run away.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.760
Disrespect! Disrespect! 
And even more unnecessary!

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.310
Your hair is a mess.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.190
Thanks, Ilia.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:35.080
If you can't even handle this by yourself, 
a dog really would be better.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.120
Euphie?

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.820
Hey, Euphie...

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.590
Are you...

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:59.010
Yeah, I think it might be a cold.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.380
Um, no, it's nothing like that...

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:05.880
Are you okay? You don't feel 
chilled, or weak, or achy?

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.480
I'm fine, really.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.940
Maybe you were in the outside air too long.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:12.190
I'm sorry.

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:15.200
No, really, it's nothing serious...

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.810
Well, it's too late to do 
anything once it is!

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:19.810
Sit tight! I'll get you some medicine!

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:21.450
Ah... Miss Anis!

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:31.240
What am I doing?

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:38.370
I'm back, Euphie!

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:41.200
Th-That certainly was quick.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:44.640
I guess we can at least get 
some medicine in you for now.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.130
Try to ignore how bitter it is.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.470
Thank you.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.060
You got it all down! Good girl!

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:00.260
Miss Anis... I'm not a child.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:04.430
Sorry, couldn't help myself. 
I <i>am</i> an older sister.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:08.860
I think it's probably fatigue. 
You can just take it easy, okay?

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.920
I'm sorry to put you 
through all this trouble.

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:15.900
It's not a problem. Just rest up.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:25.160
I think I got so wrapped up 
in making Arc-en-Ciel

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:28.270
that I wasn't paying 
enough attention to you.

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:32.210
Oh, but Arc-en-Ciel 
really is amazing, though!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.350
I love how it came out! It's even better 
than last year's masterpiece,

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.730
which they called the best in a decade!

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.280
It's elegant and profound enough

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:41.970
to be comparable to the legendary 
magic tool of the year before!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:44.620
That's why I want you to get 
plenty of rest now

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:47.140
<i>Miss Anis is like a beautiful bird 
that flies as far as it wants.</i>

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:48.960
so you'll be in top form to use Arc-en-Ciel 
beautifully and masterfully!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.360
<i>But I...</i>

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:57.240
<i>will never go anywhere. I just keep falling.</i>

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:03.010
I'm empty...

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:06.070
Euphie?

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:11.770
Are you okay?

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:20.540
I envy you, Miss Anis.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:21.650
Huh?

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.920
I have nothing.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:28.230
Nothing at all, unlike you.

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:34.010
You really are such an awkward girl.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:38.510
Miss Anis...

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:44.580
What shall I do from here on?

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.870
Good question...

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:50.550
I think you should do what you want to do.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.950
And if I don't know what that is?

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.920
I want you to give me an order.

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:00.370
An order?

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:06.800
If it is your wish as one of the royal 
family, I know I can do it, whatever it is.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:10.060
Euphie...

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:18.780
If you don't know what you want, 
or what you <i>should</i> want,

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:21.430
we can take our time 
looking for it together.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:24.770
Together?

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:29.190
I'm happy just having you here 
to laugh with me.

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:31.530
I'm going to set you free.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:33.840
But...

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.800
But you gotta get better first.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:40.270
Just stay there and don't move, okay?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.720
H-Huh?

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:43.640
Come on, hold still.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:44.990
What are you—

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:46.940
Wh...

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:48.910
Miss Ani—

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:08.600
<i>Miss Anis's warmth feels so nice.</i>

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:16.100
Yeah, I still think you're a bit feverish.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.170
No, I'm just fine.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:26.010
Come on, time to sleep. 
I'll sing you a lullaby!

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:27.760
There's no need for that!

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:43.720
Miss Anis, you'll catch a cold.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.300
Honestly...

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.900
You shine too brightly.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:56.420
You feel so warm, it makes my chest ache...

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:59.570
and I don't think I can ever let go now.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:11.490
Enter.

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.300
Pardon me, Your Highness.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.650
An inept prince under house arrest, 
and the head of the Ministry of the Arcane...

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:22.060
Should we not refrain 
from unnecessary contact?

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:26.580
Well, the truth is, 
the situation has changed.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:28.470
The situation?

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:34.860
This is the perfect opportunity to be 
freed of your meaningless house arrest.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:50.710
<i>I feel much lighter than I did yesterday.</i>

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:54.690
<i>Maybe it's because I got some rest... or...</i>

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:01.840
Miss Anis?

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:11.790
Form refinement training?

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:15.080
The princess's forms are self-taught.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.010
Ilia...

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:22.080
She's been trained by the royal 
knights in the fundamentals,

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:25.040
but most of her skills 
have been honed in battle.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.110
In battle?

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:30.770
More importantly, Lady Euphyllia, 
how are you feeling?

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:34.350
Oh... I feel much better now, thank you.

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:36.910
I'm glad to hear that.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:41.550
Perhaps the change in environment, 
and in your mentality, took a toll on you.

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:45.050
I'm grateful to both of you.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.790
You honor me.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.100
Please do take care of yourself.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:05.360
<i>I sort of followed her because 
I have nothing else to do...</i>

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.320
May I help you?

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:09.400
Uh, no, I'm fine!

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:10.520
I see.

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:19.830
You need not help me if you 
feel uncomfortable doing so.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:25.620
Do you find it difficult to voluntarily 
do things outside your given role?

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:30.570
That face says I've hit the nail on the head.

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:34.650
I, well...

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:38.120
Ever since I was young, 
I have devoted my efforts

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:42.770
to being a future queen and duke's daughter 
who would bring no shame upon the family.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:43.880
Yes.

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:49.080
I believed that was who 
everyone wanted me to be.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:53.420
So you thought being the ideal 
that everyone wanted you to be

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:56.430
was what determined your worth.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.290
I can't deny that.

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:15.190
Perhaps it's simply the princess's 
hobby to ensnare such people.

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:21.420
The relationship you share with Miss Anis 
is... well... rather unusual, isn't it?

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:25.630
Well, the princess hates being treated 
with the esteem of royalty,

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:28.490
so I play along with her silliness.

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:33.110
From the bottom of my heart, I would love 
to treat her with due respect, but alas...

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:36.310
No one else could handle her 
that way but you, Ilia.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:41.260
I was once someone who simply 
fit into a mold, as well.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:45.270
I never defied what my parents said.

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:48.170
Even when they ordered me 
to marry an old, rich man,

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:50.940
I did not question them in the least.

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:54.940
Is that... what you'd call 
fitting into a mold?

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:56.680
However...

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.640
The well-molded life I lived

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:03.570
was quite soundly shattered by a 
certain mold-breaking princess.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:05.590
Oh...

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:08.810
Now, all I want to say to my parents...

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:13.270
is that they deserve whatever 
may be coming to them.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:19.680
You have become quite the, um... 
unique character, haven't you?

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.040
You honor me.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:24.680
That wasn't a compliment...

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:26.920
And that is why...

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:31.610
I can't seem to leave you alone, 
for reasons that differ from the princess's.

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.190
Huh?

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:37.580
Lady Euphyllia, you are 
a very reasonable person.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.540
That eccentric princess aside,

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:43.600
I'm sure you were much less of 
a handful than I was back then.

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:46.080
I can guarantee it.

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:50.720
And that is exactly why you 
have every right to worry.

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.870
So please worry to your heart's content.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:59.430
The princess will buy you all 
the time you need to do so.

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:01.610
Ilia...

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:04.750
Even if it seems like it's too late,

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:08.270
she'll just say that she'll assume 
responsibility and take you in.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:10.590
Like she did with me.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:17.800
I don't quite know how to say it yet, but...

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:19.090
Yes.

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:25.310
I believe my coming to this 
villa was a good thing.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:32.220
Ilia!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.940
Euphie!

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.140
Huge news!

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:42.560
It's an urgent missive from 
the adventurers' guild!

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.110
Wait, please!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:53.780
Why would you receive a summons 
from the adventurers' guild, Miss Anis?

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.760
Well, I mean...

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:59.310
I <i>am</i> a high-ranking adventurer.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:00.930
G...

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:02.780
Gold rank?!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:07.590
But how could a princess be an adventurer?!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.990
Well, I want materials from monsters,

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:13.890
plus it's nice if I can earn 
funding for myself, right?

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.300
You've taken your devotion 
to your research too far!

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:17.440
But...

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.610
Euphie!

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:21.680
It's urgent this time.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:22.990
A huge pack of monsters—

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.770
a stampede—is coming.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:31.610
Do you know what causes stampedes?

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.800
Is it when monsters fight over territory?

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:39.410
The losing side has to go 
look for a new home,

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.800
which brings them close 
to towns and villages.

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:45.280
But there's one other cause.

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:46.450
And that is?

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:51.730
When a monster shows up 
that's so big and powerful

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:53.980
that it sends whole packs running in fear.

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:58.320
So I have to get out there right away.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:04.520
Why does any of that mean 
<i>you</i> have to go out there?!

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:10.150
Because I know for sure that this stampede 
was set off by a magicite monster.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:15.440
One that I'll never have a chance 
at again if I miss it this time.

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:18.210
The pinnacle of life itself, feared by all...

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.400
A dragon.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.870
A dragon?!

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:26.460
I want that magicite, whatever it takes.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:30.920
What impels you to go to such lengths?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.560
If I want to continue being me...

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:37.970
I have to do this.

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:46.970
<i>That's right.</i>

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:49.750
<i>She is someone...</i>

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:55.030
<i>who can fly as far as she wants, 
all by herself.</i>

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:00.840
<i>But...</i>

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.590
I understand.

00:17:08.600 --> 00:17:11.030
If you insist that you must go,

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.960
then please take me with you.

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:16.010
Huh?

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:20.030
Here is our report.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:23.060
To counter the dragon and the monster pack,

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:27.100
the royal knights and the guild are steadily 
bolstering our defenses on the front li—

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.500
Steadily bolstering defense?

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:34.030
I believe you may be misunderstanding 
the situation we're in.

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:38.010
Were this a typical stampede,

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:40.790
building a line of defense 
wouldn't be wrong.

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:44.750
But in this case, we're up against a dragon.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.450
Dragons fly, you know!

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:51.960
No amount of ground defense is any use 
against a calamity from the skies!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.600
Then shouldn't we avoid provoking it 
and pray it simply passes by?

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.940
So we just ignore the pack of monsters?

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:01.330
The dragon might target the pack.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:02.140
Surely not...

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.810
Monsters attack and eat other monsters.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:11.900
There's little doubt that the dragon's 
current target is the monster pack.

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:17.860
Which means, if we just focus on any 
monsters that stray from the pack...

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:22.330
Then you would be taking the dragon's 
prey right out from under it.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.520
Once the dragon loses its prey, 
its next target will be...

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:28.990
the capital.

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.880
We're in danger whether we defend or not.

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:37.960
There's no telling if we 
even <i>can</i> defend against it.

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:39.910
So what do we do?

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:43.930
This is the first dragon attack 
in the history of the kingdom.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.960
Nobody knows what to do.

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:49.090
Who is it?

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:50.100
Father.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:51.630
It's Algard.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.240
Forgive me, Father,

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:02.720
but I heard that a dragon has appeared.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:06.410
Just where in the world did you hear that?

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.510
You're under house arrest. 
What business is it of yours?

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:14.720
I request your permission to participate 
in the slaying of the dragon.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:18.800
Just what are you saying?!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:22.070
There is something I want.

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:27.830
I would like to receive it as a 
reward for defeating the dragon.

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:33.060
I am prepared to risk my life for it.

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:38.700
The daughter of Baron Cyan, is it?

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:42.910
I haven't the time to explain 
my feelings to you.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:44.490
But...

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:48.450
I cannot simply resign myself to this fate.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.920
<i>What is that look in his eyes?</i>

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:54.140
<i>He isn't blinded by love.</i>

00:19:54.140 --> 00:19:57.150
<i>He's simply fallen into obscuring darkness.</i>

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:02.890
To merely walk down your predetermined 
path as it was given to you...

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:07.090
Does our kingdom truly need such a king?

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:10.300
What are you trying to say, Algard?

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:15.290
"If only <i>she</i> had the 
ability to use magic..."

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:18.610
"If only <i>she</i> were a man..."

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:23.530
When such murmurs are all around me, 
do you think I don't hear them?

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:36.660
<i>When Anisphia and Algard were young, 
they were quite close.</i>

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:41.090
<i>They were always together, 
laughing at the same things.</i>

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:46.810
<i>But after Anisphia discovered 
the path of magicology,</i>

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:49.930
<i>something began to go wrong, 
little by little.</i>

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:54.460
<i>The truth is, I'm well aware...</i>

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.810
<i>that the reason Anisphia 
gave up her right to the throne</i>

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:02.090
<i>and began to behave so foolishly 
was for her brother's sake.</i>

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:06.290
<i>She wanted to make it clear that she didn't 
have what it took to assume that role.</i>

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:11.280
<i>But still, someone yet keeps 
the rumor alive today...</i>

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:15.550
<i>That Algard has no talent 
that makes him shine,</i>

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:19.740
<i>and maybe, just maybe, 
Anisphia is the one who...</i>

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:27.170
As your father, I'll ask you 
just one more time.

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:30.820
You are certain you're 
prepared to risk your life?

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:33.600
I'm prepared for everything.

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:37.300
I see it's inevitable.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:41.620
I order you as king, Algard!

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:44.490
Y-Your Majesty! I bring terrible news!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:46.560
Witnesses have reported 
that Princess Anisphia

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:51.900
has taken flight toward the Black Forest... 
with Lady Euphyllia!

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:02.510
That stupid daughter of mine!

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:05.010
Episode Four

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Episode Five
